+/* tag::reference[]
+= `BOOST_ARCH_X86_32`
+
+http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/X86[Intel x86] architecture:
+If available versions [3-6] are specifically detected.
+
+[options="header"]
+|===
+| {predef_symbol} | {predef_version}
+
