+| `+__THW_INTEL__+` | {predef_detection}
+| `+__I86__+` | {predef_detection}
+| `+__INTEL__+` | {predef_detection}
+
+| `+__I86__+` | V.0.0
+| `+_M_IX86+` | V.0.0
+| `+__i686__+` | 6.0.0
+| `+__i586__+` | 5.0.0
+| `+__i486__+` | 4.0.0
+| `+__i386__+` | 3.0.0
+|===
+*/ // end::reference[]
+
